37834>>>>>>>>>                Case Break
37835>>>>>>>>>
37835>>>>>>>>>            Case Else // must be nfUndefined
37835>>>>>>>>>                // This may be the start of a drilldown query or this may be used for some kind of custom query.
37835>>>>>>>>>                // If Row select does main-zoom we don't need this
37835>>>>>>>>>                WebSet pbRender of oDetailButton to False
37836>>>>>>>>>
37836>>>>>>>>>        Case End
